@startuml
title DMS - Domain Overview

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle

package "Auth & RBAC" {
  class AuthRbacContext {
    dmsSession
    serverRbac
  }
}

package "Document Workflow" {
  class DocumentWorkflowContext {
    workflowStatus
    finalDocumentMetadata
  }
}

package "Folder-First Archive" {
  class FolderFirstArchiveContext {
    statusBerkas
    statusArsip
  }

  class FileAccessPolicy {
    authorizedAccess
    destroyedBlock
  }
}

package "Manual Document Source" {
  class ManualDocumentSourceContext {
    manualDocumentMetadata
    attachmentMetadata
  }
}

package "Admin & Master Configuration" {
  class AdminMasterConfigContext {
    userConfig
    masterData
    kelengkapan
  }
}

package "Reporting" {
  class ReportingContext {
    finalMetadataOnly
    noFileAccess
  }
}

AuthRbacContext ..> DocumentWorkflowContext : authorizes actors
AuthRbacContext ..> FolderFirstArchiveContext : authorizes actors
AuthRbacContext ..> ManualDocumentSourceContext : authorizes actors
AuthRbacContext ..> AdminMasterConfigContext : authorizes Admin Sistem
AuthRbacContext ..> ReportingContext : authorizes Penanggung Jawab Kinerja

AdminMasterConfigContext ..> DocumentWorkflowContext : user, role, master, kelengkapan
AdminMasterConfigContext ..> FolderFirstArchiveContext : master classification

DocumentWorkflowContext --> FolderFirstArchiveContext : completed workflow documents
ManualDocumentSourceContext --> FolderFirstArchiveContext : manual documents enter berkas
FolderFirstArchiveContext o-- FileAccessPolicy : preview/download policy
ReportingContext ..> DocumentWorkflowContext : reads final metadata
ReportingContext ..> FolderFirstArchiveContext : reads archive metadata

note right of AuthRbacContext
  dms_session adalah batas autentikasi.
  dms_active_role hanya state UX.
  Server/API RBAC adalah otoritas.
end note

note bottom of ReportingContext
  Penanggung Jawab Kinerja hanya membaca metadata.
  Tidak ada akses file dari domain reporting.
end note

note bottom of AdminMasterConfigContext
  ADMIN adalah Admin Sistem.
  ADMIN tidak menggantikan Pegawai, PPK, PPSPM,
  Kepala Sub Bagian Umum, atau Penanggung Jawab Kinerja.
end note

note bottom of FileAccessPolicy
  File access selalu melewati otorisasi.
  Jika status DIMUSNAHKAN, akses file diblokir.
  Pesan aman: Data file sudah dimusnahkan
end note

note bottom
  Runtime archive authority memakai folder-first berkas.
  Removed legacy archive runtime bukan active authority.
end note

@enduml
